# .dockerignore
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Prevent unnecessary local files from being sent to the Docker daemon.
# Responsibilities: Excludes local node_modules, NPM logs, and Git files to speed up 
#                   image building and prevent overwriting containerized dependencies.
# Interactions: Read by the docker command during build.
# ==============================================================================

node_modules
npm-debug.log
.git
.gitignore
README.md
